WEBVTT

00:09:59.896 --> 00:10:02.356
and let the children run free
through his garden.

00:10:03.325 --> 00:10:07.377
And I read slowly to pay homage
to my ancestors,

00:10:07.401 --> 00:10:09.517
who were not allowed to read at all.

00:10:10.171 --> 00:10:12.760
They, too, must have circled fires,

00:10:12.784 --> 00:10:16.154
speaking softly of their dreams,

00:10:16.178 --> 00:10:18.726
their hopes, their futures.

00:10:20.417 --> 00:10:25.001
Each time we read, write or tell a story,

00:10:25.025 --> 00:10:27.300
we step inside their circle,

00:10:28.339 --> 00:10:30.509
and it remains unbroken.